# Ultramar AI invariants

Full router: [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md)

1. **No secrets in repo** — GGUF models downloaded on-device only.
2. **One heavy LLM at a time** — Qwen (brain) XOR Gemma (senses); explicit swap.
3. **Package changes need tests** — add unit test in `Packages/*/Tests/`.
4. **No auto-test** — do not run tests unless the user asks. Manual: `make test-run` or `make test-all`.

When adding LLM code, read `docs/decisions/001-llm-stack-locked.md`.
